{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22200","headline":"宿简寂观 · 白居易","name":"宿简寂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩白云尚屯，林红叶初陨。\n秋光引闲步，不知身远近。\n夕投灵洞宿，卧觉尘机泯。\n名利心既忘，市朝梦亦尽。\n暂来尚如此，况乃终身隐。\n何以疗夜饥，一匙云母粉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}